      <p source="#source-36-50"><seg source="#source-36-50">聖なる窓</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-50-85"><seg source="#source-50-85">そらのひかりはうす青み</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-85-120"><seg source="#source-85-120">汚点ある幕はひるがへる</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-120-142"><seg source="#source-120-142">Oh, my reverence!</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-142-163"><seg source="#source-142-163">Sacred St. Window!</seg></p>
    </body>
